This crate (`symphonia-bundle-tak`) is a pure-Rust demuxer and decoder for TAK (Tom's lossless
Audio Kompressor) streams. The bitstream parsing and the decoding algorithm are a port of the TAK
support in FFmpeg (https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg):

  libavcodec/takdec.c    (frame decoding: subframes, predictors, residue coding, decorrelation)
  libavcodec/takdsp.c    (the sample decorrelation and shift helpers)
  libavcodec/tak.c       (stream info and frame header parsing, CRC-24, frame sizes)
  libavcodec/tak_parser.c (frame boundary detection)
  libavformat/takdec.c   (the file header: metadata blocks, last frame, MD5)

